    <title>EP34 嘉宾集：闽超别走</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6afdb218a4a79edf137b5758</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6afdb218a4a79edf137b5758</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 14:21:19 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播：力姜&amp;一粟</span></p><p><span>嘉宾：油条哥</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="56">0:56</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="140">2:20</a>聊青岛队、全运会决赛、福清承办足球赛事与新体育场</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="221">3:41</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2435">40:35</a></span></p><p><span>闽超决赛复盘：福州 vs 厦门；福州先输两场后逆转夺冠，厦门亚军</span></p><p><span>赛程变更：因 10/31 演唱会影响，决赛提前到 10/17（另提 10/21，待核）</span></p><p><span>赛前冠军 TIFO 被对手"偷跑"引发舆论反转</span></p><p><span>榕厦球迷互相嘲讽</span></p><p><span>赛制争议：杯赛还是联赛；积分赛+淘汰赛、决赛是否应中立场地</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2897">48:17</a>"死敌"言论争议</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3141">52:21</a>包头"蒙超"MVP 被引进，引发球员资格与公平竞争讨论</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3782">63:02</a>球员资格：社保/学籍/户籍规则</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4426">73:46</a>博主与球迷小红书/微博骂战</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4746">79:06</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4784">79:44</a>福州职业队/民营资本；歌手女婿"阿龙/何龙"传闻</span></p><p></p>]]></description>
