  <item>
    <title>EP33 嘉宾集：你打着石膏还去现场看闽超？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a905b76ef65145dfcc67d8f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a905b76ef65145dfcc67d8f</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 27 Aug 2026 17:19:22 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播：力姜&amp;一粟</span></p><p><span>嘉宾：油条哥</span></p><p><span>竞技体育没有应该——只有你想不想赢。</span></p><p><span>⏱ 时间线（App 内点击时间戳可直接跳转）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 片头：闽超福州队助威歌曲《就问你福不福》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="40">00:40</a> 开场白：闽超系列第二期</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="46">00:46</a> 今晚去看平潭客场</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="166">02:46</a> 买票与看球趣事：误坐客队区"不敢加油"</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="286">04:46</a> 平潭旅游吐槽</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="406">06:46</a> 蓝眼泪与球迷社群</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="586">09:46</a> 足球小白课堂：位置与角球</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="826">13:46</a> 球衣号码文化：10号为什么是核心</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1006">16:46</a> 球星粉圈之争：不参与斗争宣言</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1126">18:46</a> 球星八卦</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1366">22:46</a> 闽超赛制与"幻觉"：龙岩0-6惨案</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1666">27:46</a> 闽超官方运营批判</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2206">36:46</a> 氛围标杆：大连英博六万人主场</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2566">42:46</a> 排球观赛礼仪之辩："取决于你想不想赢"</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3166">52:46</a> 买票难与渠道混乱</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3706">61:46</a> 自媒体新闻罗生门：胖东来搬家反转</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4006">66:46</a> 闽超官方账号现场开箱："及格线之下"</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4306">71:46</a> 上座率与新鲜度：明年还有人吗</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4606">76:46</a> 福州主场体验盘点：MC、充气棒与各队绰号</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5146">85:46</a> 散场与赛后环节：火锅店大巴接驳</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5626">93:46</a> 管理漏洞吐槽：小学生挂工作证进场</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5926">98:46</a> 一城一场的无奈：奥体办演唱会球赛停摆</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6286">104:46</a> 开场表演盘点：激光秀与外卖小哥绕场</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6466">107:46</a> 平潭与南岛语族：史前航海者的起点</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6826">113:46</a> 两岸通行的想象：金门加入闽超？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7546">125:46</a> 平潭—新竹桥隧畅想</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7786">129:46</a> 客场看球的"野"面：上海客队区见闻</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8566">142:46</a> 球迷狂热再辨："围人脱衣"算极端吗</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8866">147:46</a> 平潭要办棒球？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="9106">151:46</a> 播客自省时刻：回听前几季</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="9646">160:46</a> 流量密码与票价：9.9档的闽超</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="9946">165:46</a> 球衣定制初体验：现场烫印号码</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="10186">169:46</a> 收尾与赛前预测："没有绝对的胜负"</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="10544">175:44</a> 片尾：中超天津泰达助威歌曲《天津力量》</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjRTlJqhohyu548BL43ZYWGnv-FC.jpg"><p></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fmnd1gy6QgU8NR6Fn_YtJXPNHidh.jpg"><p></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6249664b09c321610448f9b5/lgvXZbzFxAWFBQVvFuTpKvceeTyG.m4a" length="171197532" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>02:56:15</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiNS0ZXEAYC14ERYP_nxkg42KHpS.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
