  <item>
    <title>EP32 嘉宾集：世界杯来了我仍爱闽超</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a53ad124adef2b36562d93d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a53ad124adef2b36562d93d</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 12 Jul 2026 15:22:11 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><p><span>主播：一粟 &amp; 力姜</span></p><p><span>嘉宾：油条哥</span></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><span>BGM：哈兰德之歌</span></p><p><span>BGM：seven nation army</span></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="140">00:02:20</a> 足球的魅力是？【向下滑，有齐达内】/足球和篮球比/闽超的地域攻击</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="770">00:12:50</a> 参加福州VS龙岩赛的助威团/闽超出现前的足球赛事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1720">00:28:40</a> 比起世界杯油条哥关注闽超更多/腿毛越位/越位到底是个啥【向下滑，有文献补充】/角球是个啥？/任意球又是个啥？/禁区嘞/点球/</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2300">00:38:20</a> 闽超最佳的守门员/佛得角的莆田鞋【向下滑看文献】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2800">00:46:40</a> 来自力姜莫名其妙的问题：间色草皮/裁判往哪里跑？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3090">00:51:30</a> 现场看过的排球赛/福州队的球员/讲不好故事的福建宣传/重磅开场嘉宾赵文卓【看文献】/宣传阵地在哪里？/B站看：闽超FJCL /一粟吐槽夫妻分居两地的视频【看文献】/再次批评福建的常规ending</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4170">01:09:30</a> 一粟&amp;油条哥的网球课</span></p></blockquote><p></p><blockquote><p><span>参考文献</span></p><p><span>【1】齐达内 不确定油条哥被哪个头球震撼了，所以我暂时都贴上来</span></p><p><span>用头撞了对手的胸 <a data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1La411Q7UR/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=40877d0e152e7f1968599f3fe126f5e3" href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1La411Q7UR/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=40877d0e152e7f1968599f3fe126f5e3">www.bilibili.com</a></span></p><p><span>用头撞了足球 <a data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Hv4y1Y73z/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=40877d0e152e7f1968599f3fe126f5e3" href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Hv4y1Y73z/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=40877d0e152e7f1968599f3fe126f5e3">www.bilibili.com</a></span></p><p><span>【2】越位 </span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/DzmjJUAQtLmpB1mGkzx7Eg" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/DzmjJUAQtLmpB1mGkzx7Eg"><span>mp.weixin.qq.com</span></a></p><p><span>【3】莆田鞋 </span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/eysYLKrgaom7jmLcXjrwog" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/eysYLKrgaom7jmLcXjrwog"><span>mp.weixin.qq.com</span></a></p><p><span>【4】赵文卓 </span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1VGR7B6E3h/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=40877d0e152e7f1968599f3fe126f5e3" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1VGR7B6E3h/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=40877d0e152e7f1968599f3fe126f5e3"><span>www.bilibili.com</span></a></p><p><span>为啥闽超FJCL账号里反而没有这个视频啊，赵文卓来了也不宣传吗</span></p><p><span>【5】宣传视频 </span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1cW7Q68En7/?spm_id_from=333.1387.search.video_card.click&amp;vd_source=40877d0e152e7f1968599f3fe126f5e3" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1cW7Q68En7/?spm_id_from=333.1387.search.video_card.click&amp;vd_source=40877d0e152e7f1968599f3fe126f5e3"><span>www.bilibili.com</span></a></p></blockquote><p></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6249664b09c321610448f9b5/lusbnPdD8YYLuJ8O_cfpMiFVJerl.m4a" length="71041278" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:13:08</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj1sKQvedFRVeFscfJjUrMYvzLb5.jpg"/>
